      "writtenOn": "2016-08-11T02:44:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My initial thoughts is no release name at all. How about this case:\n\nWe are going to drop a table or alter table columns, so we will deprecate the code to read the old table/columns, populate the data from the old table/columns in this releases. But we cannot just drop them in this release since the old code can still *read* and consume them.\n\nSupport the old code is deprecated for 2 release cycle, the DB schema can only be changed after 2 release cycle as well.\n\nSo the drop or alter should be done under the X+2/contract repo, right?",
      "parentUuid": "9ad45d7e_63bdd0b6",
      "revId": "25dccc02505f4d828c21c54963383802f4393ef7",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
